        <object id="atomic" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;Atomic visibility&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Step 10 commits file=ready and the complete replacement chunk set together.&lt;br&gt;Parse / chunk / embed run before this transaction. No partial index is exposed.&lt;/div&gt;" source="ingest/index.py · worker._publish_guard · ADR 0020 / 0030" tooltip="Source: ingest/index.py · worker._publish_guard · ADR 0020 / 0030">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF8F7;strokeColor=#087F8C;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1250" width="830" height="105" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="polling" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;Client polling · independent of worker timing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;GET /files/{id} → owner-scoped get_file_status() → 200&lt;br&gt;{filename, status, failed_reason, message}; failed files also return 200.&lt;/div&gt;" source="routers/files.py · files.py" tooltip="Source: routers/files.py · files.py">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="918" y="1250" width="834" height="105" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="retry" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;Retry &amp;amp; recovery&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Transient embedding failure → backoff → release job to queued.&lt;br&gt;Crash → expired lease is reclaimed; durable attempts survive restarts.&lt;br&gt;A bounded heartbeat renews the lease during ingest.&lt;/div&gt;" source="jobs/worker.py · jobs/queue.py · ADR 0028 / 0031" tooltip="Source: jobs/worker.py · jobs/queue.py · ADR 0028 / 0031">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6E6;strokeColor=#B66A08;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1385" width="830" height="150" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="terminal" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;Terminal &amp;amp; stale-worker paths&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;ParseError → failed with reason. Exhausted attempts → transient_exhausted.&lt;br&gt;Lost publish entitlement → roll back; the current owner settles the job.&lt;br&gt;File status and job state are separate; ready may precede job=done.&lt;/div&gt;" source="jobs/worker.py · ingestion failure taxonomy: ingest/parse.py" tooltip="Source: jobs/worker.py · ingestion failure taxonomy: ingest/parse.py">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF0F2;strokeColor=#BD3D4D;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="918" y="1385" width="834" height="150" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <mxCell id="upload-note" value="HTTP preflight: invalid UUID / filename → 400 · unknown or other-owner class → 404 · oversized staged file → 413 · schema → 422.&lt;br&gt;Request body middleware also applies. Its multipart Content-Length check is interim; chunked uploads can still spool before staging enforces its bound." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontColor=#52647D;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1560" width="1704" height="65" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
