        <object id="genretry" label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25&quot;&gt;Generation retry budget&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;At most 2 generation attempts total, shared across transient provider&lt;br&gt;errors and invalid output. Terminal generation error stops immediately.&lt;br&gt;A query-embedding failure has no retry budget at the ask() seam.&lt;/div&gt;" source="grounder/answer.py · ask.py · ADR 0016" tooltip="Source: grounder/answer.py · ask.py · ADR 0016">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6E6;strokeColor=#B66A08;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#172B4D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
